        <calculation class='tableau' formula='IF [Parameters].[Dimensions 1 (copy)_2071726197720924197] = &apos;None&apos; THEN &apos;&apos;&#10;ELSEIF [Parameters].[Dimensions 1 (copy)_2071726197720924197] = &apos;Area&apos; THEN [area]&#10;ELSEIF [Parameters].[Dimensions 1 (copy)_2071726197720924197] = &apos;Zone Group&apos; THEN [zone_group]&#10;ELSEIF [Parameters].[Dimensions 1 (copy)_2071726197720924197] = &apos;Zone Name&apos; THEN [zone_name]&#10;ELSEIF [Parameters].[Dimensions 1 (copy)_2071726197720924197] = &apos;Vehicle Name&apos; THEN [vehicle_name]&#10;ELSEIF [Parameters].[Dimensions 1 (copy)_2071726197720924197] = &apos;Vertical Type&apos; THEN [order_type]&#10;ELSEIF [Parameters].[Dimensions 1 (copy)_2071726197720924197] = &apos;Zone Type&apos; THEN [Calculation_2071726197486649365]&#10;ELSEIF [Parameters].[Dimensions 1 (copy)_2071726197720924197] = &apos;Day of Week&apos; THEN DATENAME(&apos;weekday&apos;,[date])&#10;ELSEIF [Parameters].[Dimensions 1 (copy)_2071726197720924197] = &apos;Time of Day&apos; THEN [time_of_day]&#10;END' />
